{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Introduce a mandatory deposit on vapes and electronic cigarettes",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "The Government should introduce a mandatory deposit of at least \u00a35 on all vapes and e-cigarettes. Backed by waste firms such as Biffa, we believe this simple, fair, efficient and cost-neutral measure would reduce fires and explosions from improper disposal while helping to tackle vape littering.",
